ted_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ni_tamagoEX/works/170", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/211846c6/uploads/origins/1f0a0d8b-a6f2-4d4e-ab10-eb752508530f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7371c927a0a9fe1fe83d90bb8aa4272f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/211846c6/uploads/origins/1f0a0d8b-a6f2-4d4e-ab10-eb752508530f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7371c927a0a9fe1fe83d90bb8aa4272f, https://si.imgix.net/211846c6/uploads/origins/1f0a0d8b-a6f2-4d4e-ab10-eb752508530f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9cdeb57862dea807a78f30df32cf0a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/211846c6/uploads/origins/1f0a0d8b-a6f2-4d4e-ab10-eb752508530f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=083cf4b32080d4b6e260d53b4d5faa5b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私の子の「軍間黒恵」と「鰐川蛇美」のイラストをお願いしたいと思いリクエストします\nhttps://x.com/87SpqYyrefubFjK/status/1917579268961530192\nhttps://x.com/87SpqYyrefubFjK/status/1917579620192510140\nおっぱいのサイズと身長の差は設定通りでお願いします！\n二人とも瞳のハイライト無し\n黒恵は無表情で片手にゴージャスボール、帽子被っている\n蛇美は不敵な笑みで片手にレベルボール", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ni_tamagoEX/works/169", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/34f3e62b/uploads/origins/934f8edc-f612-4432-8f35-bb4b804c7f75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99ecb89e09185bfbdfb032f2768a1e51", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/34f3e62b/uploads/origins/934f8edc-f612-4432-8f35-bb4b804c7f75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99ecb89e09185bfbdfb032f2768a1e51, https://si.imgix.net/34f3e62b/uploads/origins/934f8edc-f612-4432-8f35-bb4b804c7f75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e33a4ecbc2d398f3ea0f8bf9ab1ecb0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/34f3e62b/uploads/origins/934f8edc-f612-4432-8f35-bb4b804c7f75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top